{
  "id": "u21",
  "section": 2,
  "order": 0,
  "title": { "en": "Speaking exam", "uz": "Og'zaki imtihon", "ru": "Устный экзамен", "tr": "Konuşma sınavı" },
  "goal": {
    "en": "Answer an examiner: describe your hometown, give an opinion with a reason and an example.",
    "uz": "Imtihon oluvchiga javob bering: ona shahringizni tasvirlang, fikringizni sabab va misol bilan ayting.",
    "ru": "Отвечайте экзаменатору: опишите родной город, выскажите мнение с причиной и примером.",
    "tr": "Sınav görevlisine cevap ver: memleketini tarif et, görüşünü bir sebep ve bir örnekle söyle."
  },
  "guide": "pix",
  "color": "#DB2777",
  "tip": {
    "title": { "en": "I think ... because ...", "uz": "I think ... because ...", "ru": "I think ... because ...", "tr": "I think ... because ..." },
    "body": {
      "en": "A one-word answer earns little in a speaking exam. Build every answer in three steps. Opinion: I think the city is better. Reason: because it is quiet. Example: For example, I study in the park. If you did not catch the question, do not guess. Say: Can you repeat the question, please?",
      "uz": "Og'zaki imtihonda bir so'zli javob kam ball keltiradi. Har bir javobni uch qadamda tuzing. Fikr: I think the city is better. Sabab: because it is quiet. Misol: For example, I study in the park. Savolni tushunmagan bo'lsangiz, taxmin qilmang. Ayting: Can you repeat the question, please?",
      "ru": "Ответ из одного слова на устном экзамене приносит мало баллов. Стройте каждый ответ в три шага. Мнение: I think the city is better. Причина: because it is quiet. Пример: For example, I study in the park. Если вы не расслышали вопрос, не гадайте. Скажите: Can you repeat the question, please?",
      "tr": "Konuşma sınavında tek kelimelik cevap az puan getirir. Her cevabı üç adımda kur. Görüş: I think the city is better. Sebep: because it is quiet. Örnek: For example, I study in the park. Soruyu anlamadıysan tahmin etme. Şunu söyle: Can you repeat the question, please?"
    },
    "examples": [
      { "en": "I think it is a good idea.", "native": { "uz": "Menimcha, bu yaxshi g'oya.", "ru": "Я думаю, это хорошая идея.", "tr": "Bence bu iyi bir fikir." } },
      { "en": "I like my city because it is quiet.", "native": { "uz": "Menga shahrim yoqadi, chunki u tinch.", "ru": "Мне нравится мой город, потому что он тихий.", "tr": "Şehrimi seviyorum çünkü sakin." } },
      { "en": "For example, I read every day.", "native": { "uz": "Masalan, men har kuni o'qiyman.", "ru": "Например, я читаю каждый день.", "tr": "Örneğin, her gün okurum." } }
    ]
  },
